-- Q) What is HashSet?
   --> Part of java.util
       Implements Set
       No duplicates
       No insertion order
       Allows one null
       Backed by HashMap

   Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();

  --  Step-by-step insertion --
   set.add(100);

   hashCode() of 100 calculated
   Bucket index determined
   If bucket empty → insert
   If bucket has elements → equals() check
   Duplicate → ignored